OL,3,AAt least 37 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv weapons depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-seven people have died and
OL,7,Falmost 400 have been evacuated after a
OL,8,FRussian drone strike hit a depot
OL,9,Fstoring weapons for Ukraine's military
OL,10,Fnear a residential area on the
OL,11,Foutskirts of Kyiv.
OL,13,FThe strike caused shells, mines and
OL,14,Fdrones to detonate late on Friday,
OL,15,Ftriggering a blast that damaged nearby
OL,16,Fproperties including a care home for
OL,17,Fthe elderly and disabled, President
OL,18,FVolodymyr Zelensky said.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
