OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAt least 37 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv weapons depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the storage site "definitely
OL,7,Fshouldn't have been there" and that an
OL,8,Finvestigation had been launched into
OL,9,F"terrible negligence on the part of
OL,10,Fthose who stored explosive right next
OL,11,Fto people".
OL,13,FThe attack is the second to hit a
OL,14,Fmunitions depot near Kyiv in recent
OL,15,Fmonths, prompting renewed anger.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
